OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GLinton Stephens introduces an
OL,6,     Gafternoon of specially made
OL,7,     Grecordings, including a live
OL,8,     Gconcert from Wigmore Hall where
OL,9,     Gthe Consone Quartet perform Clara
OL,10,     GSchumann and Schubert.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Saint-Saens
OL,12,     GDonald Macleod explores how
OL,13,     GCamille Saint-Saens's musical
OL,14,     Ginterests took hold in childhood,
OL,15,     Gshaped by whistling kettles,
OL,16,     Gbrassy orchestras, and at his
OL,17,     Gbeloved piano.
